1
00:00:03,380 --> 00:00:05,260
拿这么多干嘛 说了只能带一个箱子
What's all this? I said one suitcase.

2
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:06,660
我需要各种备选衣服 杰
I need choices, Jay.

3
00:00:06,660 --> 00:00:09,034
在哥伦比亚没必要那么讲究吧
Colombia's not one of your more formal nations.

4
00:00:09,034 --> 00:00:11,580
有钱人坐在躺椅上都行
The guy on their money is sitting in a lawn chair.

5
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:14,620
真不敢相信我的小宝贝要离开我了
Ay. I cannot believe that my little baby's leaving me.

6
00:00:14,620 --> 00:00:16,800
我忘了关楼下的玻璃门了
You know, I left the glass doors open downstairs.

7
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,480
所以现在你真正的宝贝可能正在离开你呢
So right now, your actual baby may be leaving you.

8
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:22,520
睡袍只能带一件
One robe.

9
00:00:23,580 --> 00:00:24,760
我猜第二天早上大家都要
I guess we know what everyone

10
00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:26,800
议论我连续穿同一件睡袍了
will be talking about my second morning there.

11
00:00:27,529 --> 00:00:31,275
曼尼要去歌洛莉亚老家待一个月
Manny is visiting Gloria's family for about a month, I hope.

12
00:00:31,679 --> 00:00:33,700
我得趁歌洛莉亚情绪崩溃
I just gotta get him on a plane before

13
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:35,980
改变主意前 把他送上飞机
Gloria has a meltdown and changes her mind.

14
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:37,895
因为如果不把他送去哥伦比亚
'Cause if he doesn't go to Colombia,

15
00:00:38,523 --> 00:00:40,219
整个哥伦比亚就要找上门了
Colombia comes to me.

16
00:00:41,734 --> 00:00:42,971
先前的惨痛教训历历在目
It happended before.

17
00:00:54,540 --> 00:00:55,700
我的天啊
Oh, my god.

18
00:00:55,700 --> 00:00:57,480
-天呐 -怎么啦
- Oh, my god! - What?!

19
00:00:57,480 --> 00:00:58,420
是米奇尔 我们赢了
Oh! It's mitchell. We won.

20
00:00:58,420 --> 00:01:00,440
太好了 赢什么了
Ay, that's great! What we won?

21
00:01:00,440 --> 00:01:02,140
太棒了 我们等了那么久
It's fantastic. We've waited so long.

22
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:03,220
赢什么啦
What did we won?!

23
00:01:03,220 --> 00:01:05,840
最高法院裁决判定同性婚姻合法
The supreme court ruling. Gay marriage is legal.

24
00:01:05,840 --> 00:01:07,840
恭喜恭喜
Ay! Congratulations!

25
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:08,500
谢了 歌洛莉亚
Thanks, Gloria.

26
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:09,400
能让小卡接电话吗
Can I talk to Cam?

27
00:01:09,920 --> 00:01:11,800
好 等下
Uh, yes. Hold on.

28
00:01:11,840 --> 00:01:13,460
谢谢 谢谢 是的 是米奇尔
Thank you. Thank you. Yeah, it's Mitchell.

29
00:01:13,700 --> 00:01:14,220
喂 说
Hi. Hey.

30
00:01:14,220 --> 00:01:16,200
我得挂了 你能相信这终于成真了吗
I gotta go. But can you believe this finally happened?

31
00:01:16,380 --> 00:01:18,300
是啊 太棒了 晚上要庆祝一下
I know. It's amazing. We'll celebrate tonight.

32
00:01:18,420 --> 00:01:19,880
-我爱你 -庆祝什么
- I love you. - Celebrate what?

33
00:01:20,120 --> 00:01:21,820
杰 坐稳了
Oh. Well, Jay, hold on to your hat.

34
00:01:21,820 --> 00:01:23,120
从今天开始 在加州
But as of today in California,

35
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:25,540
法律认可同性婚姻啦
it's legal for a man to marry another man!

36
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:28,380
他吐了
Ew. He threw up.

37
00:01:28,720 --> 00:01:31,120
他只是需要点时间来接受 亲爱的
He just needs some time to get used to the idea, honey.

38
00:01:31,120 --> 00:01:32,613
太棒了 小卡
It's so great, Cam.

39
00:01:32,613 --> 00:01:33,560
是啊 真替你们开心
Yeah, I'm happy for you guys.

40
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:35,800
歌洛莉亚 曼尼需要出生证明
Gloria, Manny needs his birth certificate

41
00:01:35,800 --> 00:01:37,240
才能重新入境
to re-enter the country.

42
00:01:37,240 --> 00:01:38,380
知道在哪吗
Any idea where it is?

43
00:01:38,460 --> 00:01:38,960
我不知道
I don't know.

44
00:01:39,060 --> 00:01:41,260
对哦 他今天就走了 你一定很不舍
Oh, that's right. He leaves today. You must be a wreck.

45
00:01:41,280 --> 00:01:42,440
她没事的 她很坚强
She's not a wreck. She's a rock.

46
00:01:42,440 --> 00:01:44,080
找过了 没在保险箱里
Now, I looked, and it's not in the safe.

47
00:01:44,140 --> 00:01:45,780
莉莉上周第一次在朋友家过夜
This one had her first sleepover last week.

48
00:01:45,780 --> 00:01:47,420
我鼓励自己要坚强 挺过了一晚
I just had to tough my way through it.

49
00:01:47,820 --> 00:01:49,240
他半夜去把我接回家了
He picked me up in the dark.

50
00:01:49,860 --> 00:01:51,720
哪里都找不到出生证明 杰
I can't find that birth certificate anywhere, Jay.

51
00:01:51,720 --> 00:01:53,360
也许这是个预兆
Maybe it's a sign and --

52
00:01:53,360 --> 00:01:54,900
是个预兆提醒我们要重新讨论
It's a sign we need a refresher meeting

53
00:01:54,900 --> 00:01:55,820
保险箱里应该放什么
on what goes in the safe.

54
00:01:56,140 --> 00:01:57,720
先给你透露一点 不能放鞋
Here's a preview -- no shoes.

55
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,120
我上网查了
Look, I looked online,

56
00:01:59,180 --> 00:02:00,620
我们可以去法院要个复印件
and we can get a copy if we go to the courthouse.

57
00:02:00,620 --> 00:02:01,900
就这么办 上车
That's what we're gonna do. In the car.

58
00:02:01,940 --> 00:02:02,880
我们一个小时后就回来
We'll be back in an hour.

59
00:02:02,880 --> 00:02:06,979
小卡 恭喜 同性婚姻万岁
Hey, Cam. Congratulations. Go, gay marriage.

60
00:02:08,020 --> 00:02:09,320
他又吐了
He did it again.

61
00:02:09,320 --> 00:02:11,021
是吗
Ay, si?

62
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:12,920
好吧
Okay. Well...

63
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:26,660
跟我讲讲 小卡
So tell me, Cam.

64
00:02:26,860 --> 00:02:29,160
你们男男之间是怎么"攻做"的
How does it work when it is between two men?

65
00:02:29,320 --> 00:02:30,620
我觉得在莉莉面前
Well, I don't really feel comfortable

66
00:02:30,620 --> 00:02:31,600
谈论这种事不太好吧
talking about that... in front of Lily.

67
00:02:31,600 --> 00:02:33,400
我知道你们怎么做的啦
I know how that works.

68
00:02:33,580 --> 00:02:35,380
有次我租错碟了
I rented the wrong movie once.

69
00:02:35,380 --> 00:02:39,060
你看过《"大根"游戏》吗
Did you see "Glen, Garry, Glenn, and Ross"?

70
00:02:39,060 --> 00:02:39,780
没有
Uh, no.

71
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:41,640
-你先去一边玩 -我的问题是
- Why don't you go play? - What I mean is,

72
00:02:41,640 --> 00:02:43,060
谁该向谁求婚呢
who proposes to who?

73
00:02:43,220 --> 00:02:45,760
我不知道 我们谈过如果合法了要怎样
I don't know. We've talked about it, if it ever became legal.

74
00:02:45,940 --> 00:02:48,540
现在成真了 你今天要求婚吗
Okay, and now it is. So are you going to do it today?

75
00:02:48,620 --> 00:02:49,780
才刚刚宣布
Well, it just happened.

76
00:02:49,840 --> 00:02:50,160
我还没有...
I haven't really had...

77
00:02:50,160 --> 00:02:51,078
你一定要今天求婚
Oh, you have to do it today.

78
00:02:51,078 --> 00:02:54,460
每对爱人都应该有段美好的求婚故事
Every couple deserve a beautiful proposal story.

79
00:02:54,460 --> 00:02:57,060
我一直很羡慕我爸妈的求婚故事
Well, I have always adored my mom and dad's story.

80
00:02:57,220 --> 00:02:59,240
我爸用犁在我妈窗外的雪地里
He plowed "Will you marry me?" into a snowy field

81
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:00,560
犁出了"你愿意嫁给我吗"几个字
right outside of her window.

82
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:01,760
他们结婚25周年时
And then he tried to re-create it

83
00:03:01,760 --> 00:03:03,120
他想再重现那个场景
for their 25th wedding anniversary.

84
00:03:03,160 --> 00:03:05,520
但当时没下雪 他把字烧在玉米地里了
But there was no snow, so he burned it into a cornfield.

85
00:03:05,620 --> 00:03:06,240
大错特错
Bad idea.

86
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:09,200
但我妈确实因此又得到一枚戒指
You know, but mama did get a second ring out of it

87
00:03:09,200 --> 00:03:10,418
用紧急事务管理署发的救援金买的
with the F.E.M.A. money.

88
00:03:10,418 --> 00:03:13,400
我多希望自己也有浪漫的故事
Ay, I wish I also had a romantic story.

89
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:16,120
那天 我们在饭前看电视
One day, we were watching tv before dinner,

90
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:18,911
杰说 "曼尼 把东西给我"
and Jay says, "Manny, hand me that thing."

91
00:03:18,911 --> 00:03:20,340
曼尼就把戒指递过去了
And Manny gives him the ring.

92
00:03:20,340 --> 00:03:22,100
当然 我很开心
I mean, I was very happy, of course,

93
00:03:22,100 --> 00:03:24,220
但我总想经历更好的故事
but it is not the best story.

94
00:03:24,220 --> 00:03:26,380
至少哈维尔还是骑着海豚求婚的
At least Javier was on top of a dolphin.

95
00:03:27,600 --> 00:03:30,060
战士们总谈论将一切抛之脑后的那一刻
Soldiers talk about that moment when they shut off,

96
00:03:30,320 --> 00:03:32,020
在战争终于结束的时候
when the war finally wins.

97
00:03:32,580 --> 00:03:33,960
-蹲下 -闭嘴吧你
- Get down! - Shut up!

98
00:03:33,960 --> 00:03:35,600
我看不到电视了
I can't see the tv!

99
00:03:35,600 --> 00:03:36,660
把风扇打开
Turn the fan on!

100
00:03:36,660 --> 00:03:38,320
别鬼叫了 我脑袋都要炸了
Oh, stop yelling! My head's going to explode!

101
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:40,560
对我来说 那一刻就是
For me, that moment is

102
00:03:40,560 --> 00:03:42,100
暑假开始的第四天
four days into summer vacation.

103
00:03:43,020 --> 00:03:44,220
亲爱的 怎么了
Hey, honey. What's up?

104
00:03:44,520 --> 00:03:46,440
你还能想起当夏天只有萤火虫
Do you remember when summer meant fireflies

105
00:03:46,440 --> 00:03:49,100
热裤以及冰淇淋的时候吗
and cutoff shorts and ice-cream trucks?

106
00:03:49,100 --> 00:03:50,220
我有其中之一
Well, one out of three.

107
00:03:50,700 --> 00:03:53,720
会有时间的 他们都要出门的 对吧
We'll get our time. They're all going away at some point, right?

108
00:03:53,720 --> 00:03:55,900
是啊 海莉要去海滨
Yeah, Haley's got her beach trip,

109
00:03:55,900 --> 00:03:58,140
艾丽克斯要参加国际仁人家园活动
and Alex is doing Habitat for Humanity,

110
00:03:58,140 --> 00:03:59,300
卢克要去露营
and Luke has camp.

111
00:03:59,420 --> 00:04:00,040
没记错的话
If I remember,

112
00:04:00,040 --> 00:04:02,933
我们有六个小时清静独处的时间
I think we have six hours totally kid-free on...

113
00:04:02,933 --> 00:04:04,080
就在14号那天
oh, the 14th.

114
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:05,500
如果我们更改艾丽克斯的航班
Hey, if we moved Alex's flight,

115
00:04:05,500 --> 00:04:07,060
我们就能有10或12个小时了
we could have, like, 10 or 12 hours.

116
00:04:09,080 --> 00:04:10,480
有点野心 热裤男
Dream bigger, hot pants.

117
00:04:10,740 --> 00:04:11,620
靠边
Step aside.

118
00:04:12,380 --> 00:04:14,840
有时我不知道自己是喜欢怕克莱尔的感觉
Sometimes I don't know if I love how much I fear Claire,

119
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:16,840
还是怕自己太爱她
or fear how much I love her.

120
00:04:20,500 --> 00:04:22,420
把艾丽克斯从22号调到8号
22nd to the 8th for Alex,

121
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:24,280
把卢克调到14号
Luke to the 14th,

122
00:04:24,280 --> 00:04:26,344
把海莉调到这天
Haley gets a day there.

123
00:04:26,344 --> 00:04:28,340
-好嘞 -就是这样 真是大智慧
- Come on. - That's it, beautiful mind.

124
00:04:28,340 --> 00:04:29,920
化疯狂为美好
Harness that crazy into something positive.

125
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:32,660
如果能让艾丽克斯把仁人家园活动的地点
Shh! If I can get Alex to move her Habitat for Humanity

126
00:04:32,660 --> 00:04:34,280
从俄克拉荷马州调到萨克拉门托
from Oklahoma to Sacramento

127
00:04:34,280 --> 00:04:36,040
再让卢克更改露营的日期
and Luke to move his camp session,

128
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:38,819
他们就会和海莉的出游时间重合
they will both overlap with Haley's vacation,

129
00:04:38,819 --> 00:04:41,152
那样我们就有7天自由时间了
and I just bought us seven kid-free days.

130
00:04:41,152 --> 00:04:43,070
-点"时"成金啊 -是的
- Witchcraft! - Yes.

131
00:04:43,980 --> 00:04:45,720
我崇拜死自己了 歌洛莉亚
I've outdone myself, Gloria.

132
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:47,880
我订了我们第一次约会的餐厅
I booked the restaurant from our first date,

133
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:50,860
依然是那张能俯瞰大海的桌子
the same table overlooking the ocean,

134
00:04:50,860 --> 00:04:51,900
我会在日落时分开口
and I'll do it at sunset,

135
00:04:51,900 --> 00:04:54,000
我最近发现日落时的光线最衬我了
which I've recently discovered is my ideal lighting.

136
00:04:54,180 --> 00:04:55,300
真浪漫啊
That's so romantic.

137
00:04:55,500 --> 00:04:56,660
是啊 很浪漫吧
I know! Isn't it?

138
00:04:57,280 --> 00:04:59,320
是米奇尔打来的
Oh, okay. Oh, that's Mitchell.

139
00:04:59,380 --> 00:04:59,720
我要挂了
Gotta go.

140
00:04:59,900 --> 00:05:01,980
别让他听出来你有多兴奋
Oh, don't let him hear the excitement in your voice.

141
00:05:02,080 --> 00:05:03,240
你说得对 说得对
You're right. You're right.

142
00:05:03,828 --> 00:05:05,940
-说话 -我在三街的咖啡店
- What? - I'm at that coffee shop on 3rd,

143
00:05:05,940 --> 00:05:07,000
我忘记带钱包了
and I forgot my wallet.

144
00:05:07,140 --> 00:05:08,100
能来救我吗
Can you come bail me out?

145
00:05:08,100 --> 00:05:09,851
怎么这么巧啊
Ugh. Isn't this convenient?

146
00:05:09,860 --> 00:05:12,660
其实真的很巧 我离那里只有两条街
It actually was. I was only two blocks away.

147
00:05:14,180 --> 00:05:16,620
但我到了以后 发现是他为了求婚
But when I got there, I realized it was all a ploy

148
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:17,980
耍的小伎俩
so he could propose.

149
00:05:18,360 --> 00:05:19,660
但他这么做真贴心
But it was so sweet,

150
00:05:19,660 --> 00:05:22,960
我决定放弃自己的计划让他先下手了
I just decided to ditch my plans and let him do it.

151
00:05:34,060 --> 00:05:35,400
米奇尔 太抱歉了
Mitchell, I'm so sorry,

152
00:05:35,440 --> 00:05:38,480
但405公路上发生了严重追尾事件
But there is a massive pileup on the 405,

153
00:05:38,480 --> 00:05:40,480
我得去接莉莉了
and, well, I have to go pick up Lily.

154
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:42,800
也许你可以给克莱尔打电话求助
And maybe you could just call Claire or something?

155
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:45,600
小卡 小卡 我大概还剩50美分
Cam, Cam, I got, like, 50 cents to my name.

156
00:05:46,027 --> 00:05:47,609
你决定点什么茶了吗
Have you decided on a tea?

157
00:05:50,420 --> 00:05:51,640
价格都一样吗
Do they all cost the same?

158
00:05:53,108 --> 00:05:53,979
好吧
Yeah.

159
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:56,400
好长的队啊
Look at that line.

160
00:05:56,560 --> 00:05:58,700
大家可能都来领同性结婚证书了
Probably everybody getting their gay marriage license.

161
00:05:58,980 --> 00:06:00,680
那好像就叫结婚证书吧
I think it's just called a marriage license.

162
00:06:02,123 --> 00:06:03,778
那个 我也说不清
Yeah, I don't know.

163
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:05,600
也许我们该回家 不去了
Maybe we should go home and forget about it.

164
00:06:05,740 --> 00:06:06,040
什么
What?

165
00:06:06,260 --> 00:06:08,820
我最近在阅读一些热带疾病的资料
I've been reading up on some of those tropical diseases --

166
00:06:09,280 --> 00:06:11,000
疟疾 黄热病 狂犬病
Malaria, yellow fever, rabies.

167
00:06:11,320 --> 00:06:12,260
我属于高危人群 杰
I'm high risk, Jay.

168
00:06:12,260 --> 00:06:13,520
我喜欢与人握手
I'm a big hand shaker.

169
00:06:13,520 --> 00:06:15,120
没事的 你注射过所有疫苗了
You're fine. You've had all your shots.

170
00:06:15,120 --> 00:06:17,540
而且你喷的帕科香水会吓跑蚊子的
And that Paco Rabanne will scare away any mosquitoes.

171
00:06:18,960 --> 00:06:20,100
杰 我害怕
Jay, I'm scared.

172
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:21,780
我不确定自己想不想去了
I'm not sure I want to go through with it.

173
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:24,100
我们开了这么远的路来拿证明
We didn't drive all the way down here for that piece of paper

174
00:06:24,100 --> 00:06:26,060
可不是为了让你临阵脱逃的
for you to get cold feet at the last second.

175
00:06:26,280 --> 00:06:27,380
到底发生了什么事
And what happened, anyway?

176
00:06:27,420 --> 00:06:29,380
你几个月来一直很盼望这一天
You've been looking forward to this day for months.

177
00:06:29,400 --> 00:06:32,120
我知道 但也许我们该等到明年
I know. But maybe we should wait until next year.

178
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:33,680
我现在还太小了
I'm still kind of young to be doing this.

179
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:34,520
不能等
We're not waiting.

180
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:37,200
我已经付钱了 你妈妈也签字了
I already paid for you, and your mother signed off.

181
00:06:37,440 --> 00:06:38,520
就这么定了
This is happening.

182
00:06:41,400 --> 00:06:42,520
好日子 是吧
Great day, huh?

183
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:46,740
-我来了 -谢天谢地
- Hello! - Oh, thank god.

184
00:06:46,940 --> 00:06:48,420
我喝了好多杯茶
I've had so many cups of tea,

185
00:06:48,420 --> 00:06:49,780
他们给了我专属的厕所钥匙
they gave me my own one of these.

186
00:06:49,780 --> 00:06:51,520
给你
Ohh. Here you go.

187
00:06:51,520 --> 00:06:54,340
恭喜你们终于可以合法结婚了
So congratulations on the whole marriage thing.

188
00:06:54,400 --> 00:06:56,220
-太棒了 对吧 -是啊
- How amazing is that, right? - Yeah.

189
00:06:56,220 --> 00:06:58,068
你们很快就要举办一场同性恋婚礼了吗
We gonna hear some big gay wedding bells soon?

190
00:06:58,068 --> 00:07:00,244
叫婚礼就可以了
Ah, well, just wedding bells.

191
00:07:00,300 --> 00:07:02,560
当然啦 我们总是讨论这事
Yeah. Yeah, of course. We've always talked about it.

192
00:07:02,560 --> 00:07:02,920
但你知道的
But, you know,

193
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:05,200
只是要找到合适的时机
it's just -- just a matter of finding the right timing.

194
00:07:05,200 --> 00:07:07,028
还有其它的一些因素
And then there -- there's a couple of other factors --

195
00:07:07,028 --> 00:07:09,960
税务影响和财产规划
the tax implications and estate planning.

196
00:07:09,960 --> 00:07:11,320
打住 我都要晕了
Oh, stop. I'm swooning.

197
00:07:11,320 --> 00:07:12,600
我只是从实际考虑
I'm just being practical.

198
00:07:12,860 --> 00:07:13,780
你也是这样的人啊
You're the same way.

199
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:15,800
你叫菲尔退掉订婚戒指
You -- you told Phil to take back your engagement ring

200
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:17,215
买台洗衣烘干机
and buy you a washer/dryer.

201
00:07:17,215 --> 00:07:19,180
别扯到我身上来 拜托
Well, don't put this back on me. Come on.

202
00:07:19,180 --> 00:07:20,700
小卡最不满意你哪一点
What is Cam's biggest complaint about you?

203
00:07:21,100 --> 00:07:22,280
你不浪漫
You're not romantic.

204
00:07:22,640 --> 00:07:23,780
现在是你翻身的大好时机
This is your opportunity.

205
00:07:23,940 --> 00:07:24,980
米奇尔 你今晚回家
Mitchell, you should go home tonight

206
00:07:24,980 --> 00:07:27,720
隆重地向他求婚 给他一个惊喜
and surprise him with a big, splashy proposal.

207
00:07:28,520 --> 00:07:30,460
如果我向他求婚 他会很开心的
He would really like it if I proposed to him.

208
00:07:31,340 --> 00:07:34,180
我想下班后我可以去买张卡片
I guess I could stop after work and pick up a card.

209
00:07:34,180 --> 00:07:35,580
-然后 -天啊 你简直无可救药
- And... - Oh, my god. You're hopeless.

210
00:07:35,580 --> 00:07:37,100
-我知道 -米奇尔
- I know. - Mitchell, okay.

211
00:07:37,100 --> 00:07:39,032
-你要这样做 -天啊
- This is what you do. - Oh, boy.

212
00:07:39,400 --> 00:07:41,040
但是该由你自己想主意
It really should be your own idea, though.

213
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:43,440
不 拜托 我需要帮助 求你了
No! Come on, come on. I need help. Please?

214
00:07:43,440 --> 00:07:44,780
好吧
Fine. Okay.

215
00:07:44,780 --> 00:07:47,740
今晚 你给他做他最爱吃的菜肴
Tonight, you cook him his favorite meal.

216
00:07:47,840 --> 00:07:50,340
开一瓶最好的红酒
You open the best bottle of wine.

217
00:07:50,340 --> 00:07:53,460
当你们坐着品味美酒时
And just as the two of you are sitting down to enjoy it,

218
00:07:53,460 --> 00:07:54,620
你和他分手
you break up with him.

219
00:07:54,860 --> 00:07:55,620
什么 为什么
What? Why?

220
00:07:55,620 --> 00:07:57,565
因为在他伤心欲绝的时候
Because then, as he is at his lowest,

221
00:07:57,565 --> 00:07:58,580
你突然求婚
you pop the question.

222
00:07:58,580 --> 00:08:00,420
他会从痛苦不堪变成欢天喜地
He goes from agony to ecstasy!

223
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:01,640
多浪漫
It's so romantic.

224
00:08:02,440 --> 00:08:03,280
你在开玩笑 对吧
You're kidding, right?

225
00:08:03,280 --> 00:08:05,090
你想要更传统的吗 好吧
More traditional? Okay.

226
00:08:05,090 --> 00:08:07,320
好 你深情凝视他的双眼
All right. You look into his eyes...

227
00:08:07,320 --> 00:08:09,960
说 "我去看了医生
And you say, "I saw a doctor.

228
00:08:10,760 --> 00:08:12,120
他发现了一小块黑色的东西"
He found a small dark mass."

229
00:08:12,320 --> 00:08:13,040
你什么毛病啊
What are you?

230
00:08:13,300 --> 00:08:14,780
当他开始哭泣时
And then just as he begins to cry,

231
00:08:14,880 --> 00:08:17,360
你拿出一个装着戒指的黑盒子
you pull out a black box with a ring in it.

232
00:08:17,620 --> 00:08:19,180
这就是那个黑色的东西
There's your small dark mass!

233
00:08:19,220 --> 00:08:20,000
这主意太天才了
It's genius!

234
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:21,218
你真是个灾难
Y-you're a disaster.

235
00:08:21,218 --> 00:08:22,860
你也可以走灾难路线
You could go the disaster route, too.

236
00:08:22,860 --> 00:08:25,560
你听过我是怎么告诉菲尔我怀上卢克的吗
Did you ever hear how I told Phil we were gonna have Luke?

237
00:08:25,980 --> 00:08:28,620
我说"每天都有成千上万的儿童死去"
I said, "Thousands of children die every day..."

238
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:34,760
爸
Dad?

239
00:08:35,760 --> 00:08:38,000
抱歉 我太为你自豪而吵到你了吗
I'm sorry. Was I being proud of you too loud?

240
00:08:38,260 --> 00:08:38,920
你在干什么
What are you doing?

241
00:08:39,060 --> 00:08:41,560
做仁人家园志愿者 去帮助别人
Going off to habitat, helping all those people.

242
00:08:41,560 --> 00:08:43,320
乖女儿 我简直无语凝噎了
Honey, I'm speechless.

243
00:08:44,280 --> 00:08:45,660
谢谢 我只是觉得那...
Thanks. I just thought it was --

244
00:08:45,660 --> 00:08:46,680
但你确定要去俄克拉荷马州吗
But are we sure about Oklahoma?

245
00:08:46,820 --> 00:08:48,820
在萨克拉门托就有许多需要帮助的人
There's so many needy people right up in Sacramento.

246
00:08:48,820 --> 00:08:50,200
从家开车就能到那里
And it's driving distance.

247
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:52,065
我已经确认了我的工作细节
I already signed up for my work detail,

248
00:08:52,065 --> 00:08:53,825
也开始和同住一个帐篷的人邮件联系了
and I've been e-mailing with my tentmate.

249
00:08:53,940 --> 00:08:55,040
是啊 你说得对
Yeah. No, you're right.

250
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:57,640
我想只是...
I guess it's just...

251
00:08:57,640 --> 00:08:57,940
不
No.

252
00:08:58,700 --> 00:08:59,380
算了
Never mind.

253
00:09:00,480 --> 00:09:01,200
怎么了
What is it?

254
00:09:01,340 --> 00:09:02,080
没事 这太愚蠢了
No, it's stupid.

255
00:09:02,220 --> 00:09:03,360
只是我以前从没
I've just never been so far away

256
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:04,620
离我的小女儿这么远
from my baby girl before.

257
00:09:05,500 --> 00:09:07,420
现在别哭啊 别哭
Not now, waterworks. Not now.

258
00:09:07,660 --> 00:09:08,320
老爸
Oh, daddy.

259
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:13,340
你还好吗 爸
You okay, dad?

260
00:09:13,540 --> 00:09:15,460
你好啊 孩子 我很好
Oh, hey, buddy. Never been better.

261
00:09:15,700 --> 00:09:16,460
你真是体贴
You're so thoughtful.

262
00:09:16,700 --> 00:09:18,720
你14号去露营后我会想念你的好的
I'm gonna miss that when you go off to camp on the 14th.

263
00:09:18,720 --> 00:09:19,463
来打威浮高尔夫吗
Little Wiffle golf?

264
00:09:19,463 --> 00:09:21,738
等等 我14号没法去露营
Wait. I cant't go to camp on the 14th.

265
00:09:21,840 --> 00:09:23,280
我得和卡莉一起去
I have to go when Carly's going.

266
00:09:23,460 --> 00:09:24,140
卡莉是谁
Who's Carly?

267
00:09:25,020 --> 00:09:27,440
她是我喜欢的女孩 她就在客厅呢
She's this girl I like, and she's here right now.

268
00:09:28,420 --> 00:09:30,740
那就更应该改变露营的日期了
Well, all the more reason to change camp sessions.

269
00:09:30,740 --> 00:09:33,360
小别胜新婚嘛 这是不会错的
Absence makes the heart grow fonder. It's foolproof.

270
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:35,100
这次会错 你别想了
Not this fool. Forget it.

271
00:09:35,420 --> 00:09:37,300
你还会遇见很多新女孩的
What about all the new girls you're gonna meet?

272
00:09:37,380 --> 00:09:38,320
你才14岁
You're only 14.

273
00:09:38,540 --> 00:09:39,880
现在就想吊死在一棵树上了吗
Do you really want to be tied down?

274
00:09:40,340 --> 00:09:40,780
是的
Yes!

275
00:09:40,780 --> 00:09:43,601
卢克 瞧 我会了 好
Oh, Luke, watch. I-I got it. Okay.

276
00:09:43,945 --> 00:09:44,729
好
Okay.

277
00:09:45,920 --> 00:09:46,220
真棒
Nice!

278
00:09:46,220 --> 00:09:47,840
您好 邓菲先生
Oh, hi, Mr. Dunphy.

279
00:09:47,840 --> 00:09:49,240
抱歉我们搬开了家具
Sorry we moved the furniture around.

280
00:09:49,380 --> 00:09:50,140
我给卢克表演了
I was showing Luke

281
00:09:50,140 --> 00:09:51,620
我在翻筋斗地区赛上做的动作
the flip I did at tumbling sectionals.

282
00:09:52,420 --> 00:09:53,600
不好 是我妈妈来了
Oh, no. That's my mom.

283
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:55,900
但我可以把我带来的这部老电影留给你们
But I can leave you guys this old movie I brought over.

284
00:09:55,900 --> 00:09:57,100
电影名是《辣身舞》
It's called "Dirty Dancing."

285
00:09:58,020 --> 00:09:59,000
千万别放开她
Never let her go.

286
00:10:00,300 --> 00:10:02,400
你好 卡莉妈妈 我是菲尔·邓菲
Hey, Carly's mom. Phil Dunphy.

287
00:10:02,400 --> 00:10:03,420
你女儿的铁杆粉
Big fan of your daughter.

288
00:10:03,420 --> 00:10:04,341
-谢谢你 -放开我
- Thank you. - Get off me!

289
00:10:04,352 --> 00:10:07,280
听我说 卢克得改变露营的日期
So, yeah, heads up. Luke's got to change his camp session.

290
00:10:07,280 --> 00:10:09,020
-你们能不能也改一改 -不行
- You guys may want to do the same. - No.

291
00:10:09,020 --> 00:10:11,600
我丈夫和我这周都在算计日程
My husband and I have been working the white board all week,

292
00:10:11,600 --> 00:10:13,400
好不容易能离开这些熊孩子三天
and we just bought three days away from that.

293
00:10:15,280 --> 00:10:17,140
-又不是我干的 -你也打过去
- It wasn't even me! - Bank it!

294
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:18,560
卡莉
Carly!

295
00:10:20,660 --> 00:10:22,920
曼尼 记住 你下了飞机
Okay, Manny, remember, as soon as you land,

296
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:24,080
就留神点玛拉莉亚[疟疾]
watch out for Malaria.

297
00:10:24,240 --> 00:10:25,840
为什么 我打过疫苗了
Why? I got a shot for that.

298
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:26,720
我们能快点吗
Can we hurry this up?

299
00:10:26,940 --> 00:10:28,060
不 我说的是你表姐玛拉莉亚
No, I'm talking about your cousin Malaria.

300
00:10:28,180 --> 00:10:29,980
她去接你 但她可能带露贝拉一起去
She's coming to pick you up, but she might have Rubella.

301
00:10:30,280 --> 00:10:31,380
-什么 -那是她女儿的名字
- What? - That's her daughter.

302
00:10:31,480 --> 00:10:32,300
但在车上离她远点儿
But make room in the car

303
00:10:32,300 --> 00:10:33,440
因为她可能有白喉
because she could have diphtheria.

304
00:10:33,560 --> 00:10:34,240
谁是白喉
Who's diphtheria?

305
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:36,320
曼尼 白喉是一种病
Ay, Manny, diphtheria is a disease.

306
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:38,480
所以我要你在车上离她远点儿
That's why I want you to be apart from her in the car.

307
00:10:38,580 --> 00:10:40,400
好了 走吧 歌洛莉亚 该告别了
Okay, let's go. Gloria, better say goodbye here.

308
00:10:40,400 --> 00:10:41,920
他得抓紧去过安检了
He's got to hurry to get through security.

309
00:10:41,920 --> 00:10:43,460
-又没有排长队 -马上就要排了
- But there's no line. - For now.

310
00:10:43,600 --> 00:10:45,500
一队老年人旅游团刚到
A senior tour bus just pulled up.

311
00:10:45,500 --> 00:10:47,360
你知道他们会让警报响多少回吗
You know how much private wanding that is?

312
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:48,720
他们身上一半的骨头都是金属的
Half their skeletons are metal.

313
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:52,060
曼尼 一降落就打给我哦
Ay, Manny, please. Call me as soon as you land.

314
00:10:52,060 --> 00:10:54,220
-我会想你的 -走吧走吧
- I'll miss you. - And we're walking.

315
00:10:55,340 --> 00:10:56,140
我爱你
I love you!

316
00:10:57,580 --> 00:10:58,620
-慢着 -不 快上去
- Wait. - No. Up!

317
00:10:58,760 --> 00:11:00,120
我忘了把我写的卡片给妈妈了
I forgot to give mom this card I wrote.

318
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:01,396
别别别 我帮你给她
Uh, no, no, no. I'll handle it.

319
00:11:01,396 --> 00:11:03,230
一路平安 伙计 一路平安
Safe trip, buddy. Safe trip.

320
00:11:03,920 --> 00:11:04,760
我们走啦
We're out of here.

321
00:11:04,860 --> 00:11:06,800
别 我要目送他上楼
No, let's wait until he gets to the top.

322
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:10,400
保重 我的宝贝
Adios, mi amor!

323
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:13,000
谁想吃冰淇淋
Who wants ice cream? Huh?

324
00:11:13,040 --> 00:11:14,680
他要是不回来了怎么办
What if he never comes back?

325
00:11:14,900 --> 00:11:17,500
宝贝 哪有人离开家会不回来啊
Oh, honey, no one ever leaves home and doesn't come back.

326
00:11:17,700 --> 00:11:18,520
我就是啊
I did.

327
00:11:21,660 --> 00:11:22,580
乖女儿
Hey, honey.

328
00:11:23,160 --> 00:11:26,160
我一直在考虑你去萨克拉门托的决定
I've been mulling over your Sacramento decision.

329
00:11:26,160 --> 00:11:27,420
实际上那不是我的决...
It wasn't exactly my --

330
00:11:27,420 --> 00:11:29,000
当然 我希望宝贝女儿离家近点儿
Of course I want my baby girl close,

331
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:30,949
但我得习惯你离家在外
but I got to get used to you leaving.

332
00:11:30,960 --> 00:11:33,800
因为你上大学 而且肯定是名牌大学
Because college -- and knowing you, a great college --

333
00:11:33,800 --> 00:11:35,040
已经指日可待了
is right around the corner.

334
00:11:35,040 --> 00:11:35,840
我没说错吧
Am I right?

335
00:11:36,820 --> 00:11:39,060
参加国际仁人家园会给你的大学申请加分
Now, habitat will look good on an application,

336
00:11:39,120 --> 00:11:40,920
但萨克拉门托这地方真的对你有帮助吗
but does Sacramento really move the needle?

337
00:11:41,760 --> 00:11:43,380
我在考虑另一个地方
I have another place in mind.

338
00:11:43,812 --> 00:11:45,969
给你点提示 地名以"萨尔"开头
Little hint -- it starts with an "El."

339
00:11:46,180 --> 00:11:47,840
萨尔瓦多吗 你开玩笑吧
El Salvador? Are you serious?

340
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:49,800
那地方政局不稳定
They have an unstable government

341
00:11:49,800 --> 00:11:51,366
还是地震高发区
and -- and earthquakes.

342
00:11:51,366 --> 00:11:53,611
看这有船 好像还有山呢
Boats. Looks like there's a h-hill.

343
00:11:54,040 --> 00:11:55,860
我只是想说 你如果这个关头不逼自己
I'm just saying, you don't push yourself at this stage,

344
00:11:55,860 --> 00:11:57,566
就只能上二流大学了
you wind up at a second-tier college.

345
00:11:57,740 --> 00:11:59,140
很快你就会失去你的抱负
Soon you've lost all your ambition.

346
00:11:59,660 --> 00:12:00,960
你会一辈子碌碌无为
You're just drifting through life,

347
00:12:00,960 --> 00:12:03,403
指望有人给你个"家庭主妇"文凭
hoping someone offers you an "M-r-s" Degree.

348
00:12:06,460 --> 00:12:07,740
那是你想要的生活吗
Is that who you want to be?

349
00:12:12,920 --> 00:12:14,600
我的公主 第二顿早餐吗
Hey, princess. Second breakfast?

350
00:12:14,960 --> 00:12:15,440
有意思
Fun.

351
00:12:16,942 --> 00:12:18,680
马上要去海滩了是吧
So, big beach trip coming up, huh?

352
00:12:18,680 --> 00:12:19,080
是的
Yeah.

353
00:12:19,360 --> 00:12:20,740
没什么比七月底更好的了
Can't get better than late July,

354
00:12:20,740 --> 00:12:22,200
-除了八月初 -省省吧 老爸
- unless it's early Aug... - Save it, dad.

355
00:12:22,200 --> 00:12:24,120
我知道你和妈妈想摆脱我们独占房子
I know you and mom want the house to yourselves.

356
00:12:24,120 --> 00:12:24,650
不是的
Nope.

357
00:12:24,660 --> 00:12:26,400
就差我还没搞定了 对吧
I'm the last piece of the puzzle, right?

358
00:12:26,760 --> 00:12:27,640
开个价吧
What's it worth to you?

359
00:12:28,140 --> 00:12:28,580
好吧
Fine.

360
00:12:29,560 --> 00:12:31,380
我给你付油钱和两顿饭行不
How about I pay for gas and two dinners?

361
00:12:31,380 --> 00:12:33,164
不够 汽油费
Mnh-mnh. Gas,

362
00:12:33,164 --> 00:12:35,641
每顿饭 日用品 两套新泳装
All dinners, groceries, two new bathing suits,

363
00:12:35,641 --> 00:12:37,200
-冲浪板 还有... -你疯了吗
- a boogie board, one of those... - Are you crazy?

364
00:12:37,200 --> 00:12:39,400
-不 我还没说完呢 -你完了
- No. I'm also not done. - Yes, you are done.

365
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:39,940
知道为什么吗
You know why?

366
00:12:40,260 --> 00:12:41,300
知道还有个结果是什么吗
You know another way this shakes out?

367
00:12:41,300 --> 00:12:41,820
就是不让你去
You don't go.

368
00:12:41,820 --> 00:12:43,780
没错 你要是太过分 你爹我不干了
That's right. Overplay your hand, I pull the plug,

369
00:12:43,820 --> 00:12:45,600
你就失去了最后一次和朋友逍遥的机会
you blow your last chance for a good time with your friends.

370
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:47,100
大家会说你这人真没劲
Word gets out that you're not cool.

371
00:12:47,300 --> 00:12:48,200
然后开学了
Then school starts.

372
00:12:48,540 --> 00:12:50,080
你只好一整年死读书
You end up with your nose in a book all year.

373
00:12:50,360 --> 00:12:51,900
交不到朋友 钓不到帅哥
No friends, no dates,

374
00:12:52,160 --> 00:12:53,540
从来不打扮
not caring how you look.

375
00:12:56,020 --> 00:12:57,380
那是你想要的生活吗
Is that who you want to be?

376
00:13:03,020 --> 00:13:05,060
原来米奇尔真的是忘带钱包
Turns out Mitchell really had forgotten his wallet,

377
00:13:05,100 --> 00:13:07,160
所以他根本没想到求婚的事
so proposing wasn't even on his radar.

378
00:13:07,400 --> 00:13:08,860
我的计划无懈可击
My plan was bulletproof.

379
00:13:08,912 --> 00:13:10,840
他会像创始人日上
He was gonna be as blindsided

380
00:13:10,840 --> 00:13:12,660
最肥的猪一样被蒙在鼓里
as the fattest hog on Founder's Day,

381
00:13:12,660 --> 00:13:13,620
而我呢
And I was...

382
00:13:13,620 --> 00:13:16,340
真为我自己自豪
Pretty darn proud of myself.

383
00:13:16,920 --> 00:13:18,720
我有个理想的求婚计划
I had the ideal proposal.

384
00:13:19,280 --> 00:13:20,700
小卡曾经告诉我 他想要的就是
Cam once told me that all he wanted

385
00:13:20,700 --> 00:13:23,500
一个能和他一起坐在摇椅上慢慢变老的人
was someone to sit in a rocking chair and grow old with.

386
00:13:24,160 --> 00:13:25,260
所以我们吃晚饭时
So while we're at dinner,

387
00:13:25,480 --> 00:13:27,000
克莱尔会去准备两把摇椅
Claire is setting up two rocking chairs

388
00:13:27,000 --> 00:13:29,040
放在壁炉旁 再配上一瓶香槟
next to the fireplace, with a bottle of champagne.

389
00:13:29,301 --> 00:13:32,080
他一定会...
Ohh. He is going to...

390
00:13:32,080 --> 00:13:33,160
像四人扔猪游戏里的
Squeal like a Berkshire white

391
00:13:33,160 --> 00:13:34,356
伯克郡猪一样尖叫不止
in a four-man pig toss.

392
00:13:34,356 --> 00:13:36,324
天啊 我太想念创始人日了
Gosh durn it, I miss Founder's Day.

393
00:13:36,940 --> 00:13:39,160
来这里吃简餐也太铺张了吧
This is a little bit fancy for just a quick bite.

394
00:13:39,340 --> 00:13:40,600
没准都没有位子呢
Well, who knows if they can even get us in?

395
00:13:40,640 --> 00:13:41,680
我问问看
Let me check.

396
00:13:42,714 --> 00:13:43,528
塔克订的位
Reservation for Tucker.

397
00:13:43,528 --> 00:13:45,089
东西都布置好了吗
Is everything set up with the table?

398
00:13:46,247 --> 00:13:46,965
有位
Yeah.

399
00:13:48,660 --> 00:13:50,640
那是我们第一次约会的餐厅
The restaurant where we had our first date,

400
00:13:50,760 --> 00:13:53,220
还有小卡最爱的日落霞光
the sunset lighting that Cam loves...

401
00:13:54,020 --> 00:13:55,340
他这是要求婚的节奏啊
He was going to propose.

402
00:13:55,340 --> 00:13:57,420
我太感动了
I-I-I was so touched,

403
00:13:57,420 --> 00:14:00,440
但同时 他也在摧毁我唯一的
but at the same time, he was ruining the one chance I had

404
00:14:00,440 --> 00:14:01,600
展现浪漫情怀的机会
for romantic redemption.

405
00:14:01,800 --> 00:14:03,240
小卡 我觉得很恶心
Oh, I'm feeling really queasy, Cam.

406
00:14:03,420 --> 00:14:05,040
没事没事 我们坐下你就好了
No, no, no. You'll be okay once we sit down.

407
00:14:05,100 --> 00:14:06,460
我想我得回家 对不起
I think I need to go home. Sorry.

408
00:14:06,471 --> 00:14:08,000
不好意思 对不起
Oh! S-- excuse me. Sorry.

409
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:09,860
没事没事 我给你要点姜汁和饼干
No, no, no. We'll get you some ginger ale, some crackers.

410
00:14:09,860 --> 00:14:11,162
不行 我得直奔厕所了
Mnh-mnh. I'm -- I got to run to the restroom.

411
00:14:11,162 --> 00:14:12,337
你去取车吧
You -- you grab the car.

412
00:14:14,560 --> 00:14:16,580
你吐完就好受了
Well, you'll feel better after you throw up.

413
00:14:17,760 --> 00:14:19,420
计划有变 我们会提早回来
Okay, new plan. We're coming back early.

414
00:14:19,500 --> 00:14:20,380
都准备好了吗
Is everything set up?

415
00:14:20,440 --> 00:14:22,200
你说要两小时才回来的 我们还没出发
You said two hours. We haven't even left yet.

416
00:14:22,260 --> 00:14:24,080
-那赶紧啊 -拖延一下
- Well, hurry! - Just stall.

417
00:14:24,080 --> 00:14:26,531
就跟他说 海莉大出血了
Tell him that... Haley had a hemorrhage,

418
00:14:26,531 --> 00:14:28,165
而只有你和她血型一致
and you're her blood type,

419
00:14:28,165 --> 00:14:30,528
-所以你 -我才不要 你个食尸鬼
- so you... - I'm not doing that, you ghoul.

420
00:14:30,528 --> 00:14:32,280
快去家里准备
Just get back to the house and --

421
00:14:32,280 --> 00:14:34,340
-歌洛莉亚 -小卡 怎样啦
- Gloria. - Cam, how did it go?

422
00:14:34,340 --> 00:14:35,788
-他有没有 -没成功
- Did he... - It didn't happen.

423
00:14:35,788 --> 00:14:37,100
得实施后备方案了
I have to go with the backup plan.

424
00:14:37,100 --> 00:14:39,080
幸好我有个后备的求婚方案
Fortunately, I had an alternate proposal scenario

425
00:14:39,080 --> 00:14:40,340
以备不时之需
in case there was a problem.

426
00:14:40,980 --> 00:14:42,120
杰和歌洛莉亚在帮忙看孩子
Jay and Gloria were babysitting,

427
00:14:42,120 --> 00:14:43,540
于是我让他们重现
so I asked them to re-create

428
00:14:43,540 --> 00:14:45,020
我们搬进我们的第一间公寓
the picnic under the stars we had

429
00:14:45,020 --> 00:14:47,025
那晚在星空下共进野餐的情景
the night we moved in to our first apartment.

430
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:49,140
米奇尔肯定一看到就会...
Mitchell would take one look and...

431
00:14:49,140 --> 00:14:51,260
像获了托尼奖一样喜极而泣
Sob like a Tony winner.

432
00:14:56,700 --> 00:14:58,480
我找到了野餐篮
I got the picnic basket.

433
00:14:58,480 --> 00:15:00,500
但你知道什么东西很难找吗
But you know what is going to be hard to find?

434
00:15:00,500 --> 00:15:01,900
我对这整件闹剧的兴趣吗
My interest in this whole damn thing?

435
00:15:01,900 --> 00:15:04,174
不 是蓝白色的桌布
No, the blue-and-white tablecloth.

436
00:15:04,174 --> 00:15:06,700
找到了 在特殊场合用品柜里
Here it is. It was in the occasions closet.

437
00:15:06,700 --> 00:15:08,520
他们把工具放在枕头套里
They keep their tools in a pillowcase,

438
00:15:08,520 --> 00:15:10,160
却用整个柜子来放特殊场合用品吗
but they have an occasions closet?

439
00:15:11,460 --> 00:15:12,620
你们怎么在这里
What are you guys doing here?

440
00:15:12,740 --> 00:15:14,900
小卡要向米奇求婚
Oh. Cam is going to propose to Mitch,

441
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:16,700
我们在帮他布场
so we're here to help him set it up.

442
00:15:16,800 --> 00:15:18,400
太巧了
That is coconuts!

443
00:15:18,500 --> 00:15:20,920
米奇尔也叫我们来做一样的事
Mitchell asked us to do the same thing for him.

444
00:15:20,920 --> 00:15:22,380
这样一来我真想留下
Well, that just makes me want to stay

445
00:15:22,380 --> 00:15:23,760
看看结果会怎样
and see how this whole thing works out.

446
00:15:23,920 --> 00:15:25,660
可以啊 我们布好场 然后躲起来
Oh, we can. Let's set it up and then we'll hide somewhere.

447
00:15:25,660 --> 00:15:27,140
没错 躲进特殊场合用品柜里
Ay, yes, in the occasion closet.

448
00:15:27,140 --> 00:15:28,880
不行 我们就照吩咐办 然后离开
No. We do what they asked and leave.

449
00:15:28,980 --> 00:15:30,080
我们那辈人从没有过这种烦恼
We never had these problems.

450
00:15:30,480 --> 00:15:32,740
这就是允许男人和男人结婚的下场
This is what happens when they let men marry men.

451
00:15:34,520 --> 00:15:36,320
那肯定不是巧合
That cannot be a coincidence.

452
00:15:38,300 --> 00:15:39,340
不好意思 我绕了路
Sorry about the detour.

453
00:15:39,480 --> 00:15:41,480
我担心405公路上会塞车
I was just worried about the pileup on the 405.

454
00:15:41,480 --> 00:15:43,578
慢慢开 坐车反而让我舒服些了
Oh, take your time. The drive's actually soothing me.

455
00:15:43,578 --> 00:15:44,893
我的天
Oh! Oh, my gosh!

456
00:15:44,893 --> 00:15:45,860
搞什么 怎么回事
Oh! What -- what was that?

457
00:15:45,860 --> 00:15:47,960
我想是爆胎了 没事的
Oh. I think it's a blown tire. It's okay.

458
00:15:47,960 --> 00:15:49,968
还有备胎 有工具吗
Well, I know there's a spare. Do -- do we have the tools?

459
00:15:49,968 --> 00:15:52,646
-有的 在后备箱的枕头套里 -好
- Yeah, yeah. They're in the pillowcase in the trunk. - Right.

460
00:15:53,400 --> 00:15:55,220
你为什么要这样不耐烦
Why do you have to be so grouchy?

461
00:15:55,220 --> 00:15:57,280
我们在为他们创造美好的故事
We're giving them a beautiful story.

462
00:15:57,700 --> 00:15:59,080
每个人都值得拥有一个美好回忆
Everybody deserves one.

463
00:15:59,960 --> 00:16:00,600
我是个白痴
I'm an idiot.

464
00:16:00,880 --> 00:16:03,600
你不是白痴 你不像别人那样浪漫
Oh, you're not an idiot. You're not as romantic as some --

465
00:16:03,600 --> 00:16:05,240
这些东西背面就有双面胶
These things peel off on the back,

466
00:16:05,240 --> 00:16:06,500
而我还一直在用胶水粘
and I've been gluing 'em.

467
00:16:06,500 --> 00:16:09,180
我费个什么劲 你根本不在乎这些感觉
Why do I even bother? You don't care about this stuff.

468
00:16:09,500 --> 00:16:10,640
你这是什么意思
What's that supposed to mean?

469
00:16:10,640 --> 00:16:12,197
就像你向我求婚的时候
Yeah, like when you proposed to me.

470
00:16:12,208 --> 00:16:14,220
你说"曼尼 把那个东西给我"
"Hey, Manny, hand me that thing."

471
00:16:14,220 --> 00:16:15,120
那就是我的故事
That's my whole story.

472
00:16:15,220 --> 00:16:16,680
慢着 那不是我的错
Hang on. That wasn't my fault.

473
00:16:16,720 --> 00:16:17,940
我本来安排好了
I had something big planned.

474
00:16:18,080 --> 00:16:19,440
你叫他把戒指给你
You asked him for the ring.

475
00:16:19,560 --> 00:16:21,960
我指的是遥控器 他自己偷跑了
I was asking for the remote. He jumped the gun.

476
00:16:22,100 --> 00:16:23,480
他本该在当天晚些时候
He was supposed to give me the ring

477
00:16:23,480 --> 00:16:24,980
在餐厅里把戒指递给我的
later that night at the restaurant.

478
00:16:25,360 --> 00:16:27,360
服务员会来问我们要不要咖啡
The waiter was gonna come by and offer coffee.

479
00:16:27,520 --> 00:16:29,720
我会说"不用了 谢谢 喝了睡不着
I was gonna say, "No, thank you. It'll keep me up,

480
00:16:29,740 --> 00:16:31,380
这段时间 我一直活在梦中
and lately, I've been loving my dreams,

481
00:16:31,420 --> 00:16:34,060
有一个梦 我希望能成为现实"
and there's one in particular I hope comes true."

482
00:16:34,520 --> 00:16:35,440
然后曼尼会把戒指给我
Manny gives me the ring.

483
00:16:35,800 --> 00:16:36,720
我说 "歌洛莉亚"
I say, "Gloria --"

484
00:16:36,980 --> 00:16:39,720
我愿意 杰 我愿意嫁给你
Yes, Jay! Yes, I marry you!

485
00:16:40,560 --> 00:16:42,790
我喜欢我的新故事
I love my new story.

486
00:16:46,140 --> 00:16:48,640
提醒下 我绝对会在他们的婚礼上哭的
Little heads-up -- there's no way I'm not crying at this wedding.

487
00:16:49,120 --> 00:16:50,440
菲尔 你来这里的路上就哭了
Phil, you cried on the way here.

488
00:16:50,440 --> 00:16:52,180
我当时已经泪在眼眶了
I was on the brink already.

489
00:16:53,140 --> 00:16:54,820
我出门前看了《辣身舞》
I watched "Dirty Dancing" before we left.

490
00:16:57,820 --> 00:16:58,880
我爸的短信
Text from my dad.

491
00:16:59,120 --> 00:16:59,980
不好
Oh, no.

492
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:02,760
他要我过去看望他几天
He wants me to come visit him for a couple of days,

493
00:17:02,780 --> 00:17:04,540
正好是孩子们都出门的那周
but it's right in the middle of our kid-free week.

494
00:17:04,700 --> 00:17:07,220
太可惜了 我想你去两天没问题
Oh, that's too bad. I guess you could take two days.

495
00:17:08,120 --> 00:17:09,880
我可能跟弗兰克说过
I may have mentioned to Frank

496
00:17:09,880 --> 00:17:11,860
菲尔那周可能有空
that Phil might be available that week.

497
00:17:12,224 --> 00:17:14,080
唯一比孩子们都出门更棒的
The only thing better than a kid-free week

498
00:17:14,080 --> 00:17:17,000
就是再挤出几天让我独处
is a couple of days carved out just for mama.

499
00:17:19,140 --> 00:17:19,540
完美
Perfect.

500
00:17:20,520 --> 00:17:20,920
是的
Yeah.

501
00:17:23,089 --> 00:17:25,140
还记得我向你求婚的那天吗
Hey, you remember the day I proposed to you?

502
00:17:25,140 --> 00:17:26,180
当然记得
Of course I do.

503
00:17:26,280 --> 00:17:28,060
我不太记得是哪一天了 但我记得
I don't remember the exact date, but, yes.

504
00:17:28,060 --> 00:17:30,700
1994年3月19日
March 19, 1994.

505
00:17:30,700 --> 00:17:31,500
是哦
Oh. Yeah.

506
00:17:31,500 --> 00:17:33,420
那天下午我心情相当不好
I was in such a bad mood that afternoon.

507
00:17:33,500 --> 00:17:35,900
圣帕特里克节喝醉后的第二天宿醉
I was on day two of a St. Patrick's hangover.

508
00:17:36,140 --> 00:17:37,320
我不记得这点
I don't remember that.

509
00:17:37,820 --> 00:17:40,160
我只记得我爱得有多疯狂
I just remember how crazy in love I was.

510
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:42,460
我等不及想向你求婚
I couldn't wait to ask you.

511
00:17:43,780 --> 00:17:45,680
去接你的路上甚至闯了个红灯
I even ran a red light on the way to pick you up.

512
00:17:46,200 --> 00:17:47,480
罚单我还留着
I still have the ticket.

513
00:17:48,360 --> 00:17:50,480
不可能 你为什么要说这样的话
No, you don't. Why would you say something like that?

514
00:17:50,560 --> 00:17:52,660
开什么玩笑 我在冲向我的新人生
Are you kidding me? I was racing to my life.

515
00:17:52,660 --> 00:17:53,803
罚单就在我爸家
It's in a box at my dad's

516
00:17:53,820 --> 00:17:54,720
和其他东西存在一个盒子里
with a bunch of other stuff --

517
00:17:55,080 --> 00:17:57,840
包括你我相识的那场音乐会的节目单
The program from that concert where I met you...

518
00:17:59,040 --> 00:18:01,940
你给我的写着假电话号码的火柴盒
...the matchbook with the fake number on it you gave me...

519
00:18:02,140 --> 00:18:04,600
我们第一次约会的纪念酒杯
The souvenir goblet from our first date.

520
00:18:05,500 --> 00:18:09,440
你觉得我会把这些美好回忆扔掉吗
You really think I'd throw away all those beautiful memories...

521
00:18:09,440 --> 00:18:10,470
我的夫人
...milady?

522
00:18:14,580 --> 00:18:16,700
我已经很久没再看看那些东西了
I haven't seen that stuff for a long time.

523
00:18:16,700 --> 00:18:18,640
我去见我爸时一定要翻出来
I got to dig it out when I see my dad.

524
00:18:18,640 --> 00:18:20,420
好了 别说了 对不起
Okay, stop. Sorry.

525
00:18:20,560 --> 00:18:20,780
怎么了
What?

526
00:18:21,280 --> 00:18:23,520
我让你爸爸找你的
I told your dad to call you

527
00:18:23,520 --> 00:18:26,180
因为我想有几天单独清静的时间
because I wanted some time for myself.

528
00:18:26,680 --> 00:18:31,000
是的 几天远离我那完美浪漫的丈夫
Yeah, couple of days away from my perfect, romantic husband,

529
00:18:31,000 --> 00:18:32,280
我这个铁石心肠
who is far too good

530
00:18:32,280 --> 00:18:35,926
冷血无情的机器人根本配不上的好丈夫
for this cold-hearted, bloodless wife-bot.

531
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:39,260
你不冷血
You have blood.

532
00:18:39,460 --> 00:18:42,180
亲爱的 我只是把椅子放在了火炉前
Honey, I just put the chairs in front of the fireplace.

533
00:18:42,260 --> 00:18:43,220
你却布置得这么浪漫
You made it romantic.

534
00:18:43,800 --> 00:18:45,520
米奇尔说得对 我是个食尸鬼
Mitchell's right. I'm a ghoul.

535
00:18:45,980 --> 00:18:46,620
过来
Come here.

536
00:18:49,660 --> 00:18:52,040
你有你自己有趣的浪漫方式
You're romantic, too, in your own funny way.

537
00:18:52,140 --> 00:18:52,780
我们只是不同
We're just different.

538
00:18:53,960 --> 00:18:55,600
我更多愁善感些又如何
So what if I'm more sentimental?

539
00:18:56,960 --> 00:18:57,680
是我妈
My mom.

540
00:18:58,020 --> 00:18:59,560
我是说 当然
I mean, sure...

541
00:19:00,300 --> 00:19:01,580
婚姻需要浪漫
Marriage needs romance.

542
00:19:01,920 --> 00:19:03,120
知道还需要什么吗
You know what it also needs?

543
00:19:03,380 --> 00:19:06,440
"菲尔联系过我 他建议..."
"Spoke to Phil, and he suggested --"

544
00:19:06,440 --> 00:19:06,780
宽容
Forgiveness.

545
00:19:10,580 --> 00:19:12,160
好了 请给我备胎
Okay. Spare, please.

546
00:19:12,340 --> 00:19:13,140
是的 医生
Yes, doctor.

547
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:15,900
真不敢相信我们碰到这种事太多次了
I can't believe this has happened to us so many times,

548
00:19:15,900 --> 00:19:16,940
居然有了换胎的固定程序
we actually have a system.

549
00:19:16,940 --> 00:19:18,880
我知道 从你第一次看到千斤顶
Oh, I know. You've come a long way

550
00:19:18,880 --> 00:19:20,780
这一路走来你可不容易
from the first time you ever saw a jack.

551
00:19:20,780 --> 00:19:21,620
记得吗 你不相信...
Remember, you couldn't believe...

552
00:19:21,620 --> 00:19:22,220
抱歉 这真是太棒了
I'm sorry. This is amazing.

553
00:19:22,520 --> 00:19:24,140
我正在抬起一辆车
I am lifting a car right now.

554
00:19:24,140 --> 00:19:26,045
我是全世界最强壮的男人
I am the strongest man in the world.

555
00:19:26,920 --> 00:19:28,600
还记得那次在约塞米蒂国家公园
Oh, do you remember that time in Yosemite

556
00:19:28,600 --> 00:19:29,960
雪下得非常大吗
when it was snowing so bad?

557
00:19:30,400 --> 00:19:31,740
记得 那是六年前吗
Yeah. What was that, like six years ago?

558
00:19:31,740 --> 00:19:33,280
老天 不 是在领养莉莉之前
Oh, gosh. No, it was before Lily,

559
00:19:33,340 --> 00:19:35,320
所以至少有七八年了
so it was at least seven or eight.

560
00:19:35,916 --> 00:19:38,189
老天 时间过得真快
God, it is -- it's going by so fast.

561
00:19:38,199 --> 00:19:40,194
对 那还用说
Yeah. You're telling me.

562
00:19:43,460 --> 00:19:45,140
知道吗 24小时之前 这下面
You know, it's a different world down there

563
00:19:45,140 --> 00:19:46,560
是一个完全不同的世界
than it was 24 hours ago.

564
00:19:47,759 --> 00:19:48,977
小卡 轮胎 轮胎
Cam, tire. Tire!

565
00:19:48,977 --> 00:19:50,940
老天 我的天 我的天
Oh, my gosh. Oh, my -- oh, my god.

566
00:19:50,940 --> 00:19:52,060
我的天
Oh, my god!

567
00:19:53,774 --> 00:19:54,800
对住在那个黄色房子里的人来说
It's gonna be a different world

568
00:19:54,800 --> 00:19:56,020
世界也将要变得不同了
for the people in that yellow house.

569
00:19:59,080 --> 00:20:02,640
我今晚的计划绝对不是这样的
This is not at all how I saw the evening going.

570
00:20:03,600 --> 00:20:05,820
亲爱的 你绝对想不到
Honey, you have no idea.

571
00:20:08,360 --> 00:20:10,280
你还记得我们的第一间公寓吗
Do you remember our first apartment?

572
00:20:10,394 --> 00:20:13,440
记得 你怎么想到那个了
Yes. What -- what made you think of that?

573
00:20:13,440 --> 00:20:14,430
我不知道
I don't know.

574
00:20:15,640 --> 00:20:16,600
星空
The stars.

575
00:20:18,320 --> 00:20:20,900
好了 来吧 换胎
All right. Come on. Let's do this.

576
00:20:21,240 --> 00:20:21,780
好
Yeah.

577
00:20:35,029 --> 00:20:36,287
-我愿意 -我愿意
- Yes. - Yes.

578
00:20:41,180 --> 00:20:43,640
大腿上有星星的这位美女
Hey, there, you with the stars on your thighs.

579
00:20:43,640 --> 00:20:46,546
-什么 -是首老歌 我是想...
- Huh? - It's an old song. I thought I would...

580
00:20:47,126 --> 00:20:48,718
我费个什么劲
Eh, why do I bother?

581
00:20:49,711 --> 00:20:51,480
-这是什么 -曼尼给的
- What is this? - Oh. Oh, that's from Manny.

582
00:20:51,480 --> 00:20:54,040
我本想过几天再给你
I was hoping to wait and give it to you in a couple of days.

583
00:20:54,040 --> 00:20:57,280
你要记住他很好
But, uh, just remember that he's fine.

584
00:20:57,340 --> 00:20:59,140
他离你的距离坐飞机就能到
He's only a plane ride away.

585
00:21:00,040 --> 00:21:00,500
不错
Nice.

586
00:21:01,140 --> 00:21:02,360
我去洗脸了
I'm going to wash my face.

587
00:21:02,680 --> 00:21:03,140
好的
Okay.

588
00:21:03,520 --> 00:21:06,800
希望我的表兄弟姐妹们不要带他去骑马
I hope that my cousins don't take him riding the horses

589
00:21:06,800 --> 00:21:08,240
或是玩枪
or shooting the guns.

590
00:21:08,880 --> 00:21:12,680
我知道他已经算是个成年男人了 但
I know that he's almost a man, but...

591
00:21:14,580 --> 00:21:15,180
杰
Jay?

592
00:21:15,760 --> 00:21:17,140
"你要照顾好杰
"Make sure you take care of Jay.

593
00:21:18,100 --> 00:21:20,340
他周四体检后请给我打电话
Please call me after his checkup on Thursday.

594
00:21:21,500 --> 00:21:23,220
我会非常想你们的"
I'll miss you guys so much."

595
00:21:23,680 --> 00:21:24,360
真懂事 是吧
Nice, huh?

596
00:21:24,760 --> 00:21:25,360
只是懂事吗
Nice?

597
00:21:26,730 --> 00:21:28,320
我去把他的另一件睡袍寄给他
I'm gonna mail him his other robe.
